{"sections":[{"slug":"可积联络","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"可积联络"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">可积联络</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"aliases":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">平坦联络</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">平坦向量丛</span>"},"page-title":{"Plain":"“可积联络”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">又称平坦联络</span>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann--Hilbert对应","text":"Riemann–Hilbert <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的研究对象</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑主丛</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于拓扑群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">与拓扑空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $P$, <span lang=\"zh\">若以下三条等价的条件成立</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">平坦</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$P$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导自</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的万有覆盖</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $\\pi_1(X)$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">与同态</span> $\\pi_1(X)\\to G$, <span lang=\"zh\">又称基本群的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">和乐表示</span></strong> (holonomy representation);</li>\n<li>$P$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导自某个</span> $G_d$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛与同态</span> $\\operatorname{id}\\colon G_d\\to G$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $G_d$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的底层离散群</span>;</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和乐","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和乐</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span> $\\Omega(X)\\to G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">同伦</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的意义下分解穿过投影</span> $\\Omega(X)\\to \\pi_1(X)$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}